ia-labelledby="guided-view-tables" ${currentView==='tables'?'':'hidden'}><div id="forecast-detail"></div></section></section><section class="assumptions-column workspace-editor" aria-label="Base-case inputs"><div class="assumptions-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">BASE CASE</span><h2>Shape the business</h2></div><span class="auto-status">Live</span></div><div class="assumption-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Assumption categories">${groups.map(g=>`<button id="group-${g.id}" role="tab" aria-selected="${draft.step===g.id}" aria-controls="editor-group-${g.id}" data-step="${g.id}" tabindex="${draft.step===g.id?'0':'-1'}">${g.name}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="assumption-issue" class="assumption-issue" role="note" aria-labelledby="assumption-issue-title" hidden><h3 id="assumption-issue-title">Value withheld</h3><p id="assumption-issue-message"></p></div><div id="assumption-editor" data-group="${draft.step}" aria-labelledby="group-${draft.step}" class="assumption-editor pane-scroll">${editorPanes()}</div><div class="draft-footer"><span id="guided-save-state"></span><button id="export-draft" class="text-button">Export</button></div></section></div><div class="workspace-evidence-host"></div><div hidden class="workspace-evidence-depot"><section data-evidence-source="case">${completeResearchPanel().replace('id="use-research"','id="evidence-use-research"').replace('id="complete-research-status"','id="evidence-complete-research-status"')}${baseCasePanel()}${operatingProfilePanel()}${dataOptions()}</section><section data-evidence-source="quote">${quoteForm()}</section><section data-evidence-source="limits"><details open id="model-limits" class="model-caveats"><summary>Model limits & unresolved claims</summary><p>Nominal FCFF; selected growth path and maturity; simplified incremental reinvestment. Revenue growth, margin and capital efficiency have separate timing controls; saved older paths retain their existing timing until edited. WACC is constant. Maintenance replacem